Package: router-billing
Version: 0.6
Architecture: aarch64_generic
Maintainer: router-billing
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: WiFi captive portal billing system. Free SSID + paid SSIDs with per-MAC billing.
 Supports WeChat Pay / Alipay (Native + outbound polling), redemption vouchers,
 user accounts, real-time admin device list, automatic backups.
Depends: nftables, iproute2, kmod-nft-nat
Source: https://localhost
